fornia, focuses on the titular character (played by Mara Wilson), who grows up unseen and unheard by her grifter, TV-obsessed parents, Harry and Zinnia Wormwood, played by DeVito and his then-wife Rhea Perlman.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/film/2026/jul/20/why-matilda-is-my-feelgood-movie">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;8VAJLb9x3SwNBCJ7Q-QNVeV7ulmZLaTcmvRBBwouIdsƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;kR_OJVhoAw3mGlUeFpcvoqqlE86KTvwIZhl4FKURmSwƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;I8e8apoMdqq79CUYqe9-9iACbZpRwt04UxzEzRCZfkIƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;srIe-MpD_F-otDWcx5mGveL-gm_5kIKgBpBMA1bP-IUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;C7m1yFCcVLgGWzKboCEQZem3tXC7LV4VIBmJioITb0kƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;2CIkbphqHHCD-50ECrLfIkOQ9EqetICnWhglnNoYCbgƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;1KU458bUG64gvutwZxTkg90pbUnG0Ve2YY0MzfkqqV8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdTextƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;UyJFhpPJVFBMEVV3twATAz48XusmJnzgsvOK8sFKedAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkqSyndicationSourceƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;TH7_AZQCg0wAyd0YG5o5luUHGgQbvSH8dp6pfs4VDtIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx(urn:rmn:predicate:source-reports-summaryƒdpai